        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A comeback is rarely one big moment. It is a thousand small ones: getting up, showing up, starting again. We wanted to make something that stays with you through all of them.</p><p>So every EvlveX pair carries the monogram on its side: a small mark for a big decision. Not to say you have arrived. To say you never gave up.</p>"
